§§ `s 35(1) "contiguous zone"`

-- Plain gloss: in relation to Canada, the contiguous zone is the one determined under the Oceans Act; in relation to any other state, the
-- one determined in accordance with international law and that state's own domestic laws.
-- src:286 | contiguous zone,
