@ref Interpretation Act s 35(1) "province" (src:330)
GIVEN p IS A `A province or territory`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is a province within section 35(1)` p MEANS
    TRUE

-- src:330 | province means a province of Canada, and includes Yukon, the Northwest Territories and Nunavut; (province)
@ref Interpretation Act s 35(1) "province" (src:330)
GIVETH A `A definition`
`the definition of the term province` MEANS
    `A definition`
        WITH `the terms` IS LIST "province"
             `its section` IS "35(1)"
             `how it speaks` IS `means, and also includes`
             `what it names` IS LIST "a province of Canada"
                                    , "Yukon"
                                    , "the Northwest Territories"
                                    , "Nunavut"
             `what it excludes` IS EMPTY
             `what it points at` IS NOTHING

§§ `s 35(1) "radio or radiocommunication"`

-- Plain gloss: any transmission, emission or reception of signs, signals, writing, images, sounds or intelligence of any nature by
-- electromagnetic waves of frequencies lower than 3 000 GHz propagated in space without artificial guide.  Exactly 3 000 GHz is not lower.
-- src:331 | radio or radiocommunication means any transmission, emission or reception of signs, signals, writing, images, sounds or intelligence of any nature by means of electromagnetic waves of frequencies lower than 3 000 GHz propagated in space without artificial guide; (radiocommunication ou radio)
@ref Interpretation Act s 35(1) "radio or radiocommunication" (src:331)
GIVEN `it is a transmission, emission or reception of signs, signals, writing, images, sounds or intelligence of any nature` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the waves are electromagnetic` IS A BOOLEAN
      `their frequency in gigahertz` IS A NUMBER
      `they are propagated in space without artificial guide` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is radiocommunication within section 35(1) where` `it is a transmission, emission or reception of signs, signals, writing, images, sounds or intelligence of any nature` `by waves that are electromagnetic` `the waves are electromagnetic` `of a frequency in gigahertz of` `their frequency in gigahertz` `propagated without artificial guide` `they are propagated in space without artificial guide` MEANS
        `it is a transmission, emission or reception of signs, signals, writing, images, sounds or intelligence of any nature`
    AND `the waves are electromagnetic`
    AND `their frequency in gigahertz` < 3000
    AND `they are propagated in space without artificial guide`

